                        "form": "non binaire"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "e06c0689-60fb-3667-b2d8-b2434673eff5",
                        "entry_id": "fd7ce902-29af-3abe-9a6e-b6d4e0918443",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Personne dont l’identité de genre n’est ni exclusivement femme ni exclusivement homme, en-dehors du concept de la binarité de genre."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "LGBTQ"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "b3a1bea2-956b-4e89-a056-0218233690d7",
                                "sense_id": "e06c0689-60fb-3667-b2d8-b2434673eff5",
                                "text": "Agenre, non-binaire, genderfluid, c’est pour « rendre visibles » tous ces homologues IEl et ceux qui flottent dans leur genre, que Ten … s’est lancé.e en mars dans un projet photographique."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "cebfa3a8-940c-43e0-9408-d3d884a1baa7",
                                "sense_id": "e06c0689-60fb-3667-b2d8-b2434673eff5",
                                "text": "Dans cette mesure, plus que la place de l’embyphobie et des non-binaires dans la lutte contre le patriarcat, c’est la façon dont iels organisent cette lutte qui a toute son importance il me semble."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "fb29aa98-d34b-45dd-9462-28eecbda9a84",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd7ce902-29af-3abe-9a6e-b6d4e0918443",
                        "source_sense_id": "e06c0689-60fb-3667-b2d8-b2434673eff5",
                        "target_lang_word": "Enby",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Enby",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                        "entry_id": "cc610b5f-ea50-356f-bbbd-62cb02e0f82f",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "nichtbinäre/diversgeschlechtliche Person"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "854076ee-be90-40fd-b3ca-8b8e4d41b56b",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Zwei Dutzend Leute, die sich nun in der Fahrzeugbaracke befinden, setzen sich ebenfalls, Enbys, Frauen, Männer.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "493b290b-4dd4-4dff-ac32-c42147761e28",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Ich will Frauen, Queers, Trans und Enbys empowern.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "04b7174e-4720-4a15-afa2-399a06895ca3",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Wir möchten, dass darin Enbys, Women of Color und trans Frauen genauso sichtbar sind wie asexuelle cis Frauen oder ältere Frauen mit Behinderung.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "1b6a1984-6d22-4c86-8247-6dfe2b81bef4",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Sie erklären, was Enbys, genderqueere, genderbender, inbetween, postgender oder diverse bedeutet.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "d3640e3b-b728-4b1b-9e0e-aef77b17052a",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Ich bin ein Enby. N.B. Nichtbinär. Binär; das bedeutet Mann und Frau. Das bin ich nicht.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e4ac867f-58e2-4008-8db0-7d8a83cdc796",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Diese Gemeinschaft bestand aus tausenden von Annas. Und abertausenden von was auch immer das Äquivalent einer Anna für einen trans Mann ist. Oder ein Enby. Oder eine nicht-binäre Person, die kein Enby ist.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6fdb1c03-2221-4fd6-a6c6-d12c1ea26e33",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Wenngleich auch das Virus oft Zweifel dran sät // Du bleibst. Das Enby, das überlebt. // Und jedes Mal, wenn dich einer sieht // Bist du ein Schlag in die Mauer.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "75a51f09-b0d2-4da7-8340-6e51d3b80552",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Kurz und gut – das gesamte Portfolio um nur ein Produkt an den Mann, die Frau, das Enby zu bringen.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "6a868ed3-90a1-426e-b5c2-6be5cd86e05c",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Werden höfliche Anreden wie Enby / Anby gewünscht, nutzen Sie diese: Sehr geehrtes Enby Curly Smith.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "3e022ebb-0d8d-4423-a30d-95ef13ab8aaa",
                                                "sense_id": "992395be-78c8-3ee4-8d76-5da3cebb43d1",
                                                "text": "„Neyma und Maru habe ich gefragt, was sie von der Enby-Anrede halten. Während Maru sich mit Enby richtig angesprochen fühlt, ist für Neyma die Anrede eher ‚alienhaft‘, wie vom anderen Stern oder sogar abwertend verniedlichend.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "2a5bed30-8780-4036-bc7a-54c6a9ca1781",
                        "source_entry_id": "fd7ce902-29af-3abe-9a6e-b6d4e0918443",
                        "source_sense_id": "e06c0689-60fb-3667-b2d8-b2434673eff5",
                        "target_lang_word": "enby",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "enby",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "a8908509-2e8a-313e-b7ef-a7b7973add01",
                                        "entry_id": "77940172-f414-330f-8570-f9eab69654d7",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pronunciation spelling of NB (“a non-binary person; a person whose gender identity is not strictly female or male; one who is outside of the gender binary”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "informal",
                                            "neologism",
                                            "pronunciation-spelling"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a89eb1bf-2042-418e-85f3-762fe682f857",
                                                "sense_id": "a8908509-2e8a-313e-b7ef-a7b7973add01",
                                                "text": "i wish there was an nb equivalent to words like boys and girls / nb / enby / enbies"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "044ee9fb-9ee1-4c47-9180-6eb156d79e5b",
                                                "sense_id": "a8908509-2e8a-313e-b7ef-a7b7973add01",
                                                "text": "I doubt most wedding fair vendors would recognise an enby even if you carried an explanatory sign."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "e37ee54e-2104-4fac-9b6c-43a29f4534f2",
                                                "sense_id": "a8908509-2e8a-313e-b7ef-a7b7973add01",
                                                "text": "So, boys and girls and enbies, if the sex isn't good at or very near the beginning, the passage of time and/or muttering of vows isn't going to fix it."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c6d6bba1-d647-4778-af1b-c0bae3afc68b",
                                                "sense_id": "a8908509-2e8a-313e-b7ef-a7b7973add01",
                                                "text": "'Ladies and enbies,' she said, the five foot three height requirement for pilots continued to mean that nearly all the human fighter pilots she had ever met were women or enbies. She could see no evidence before her that anything had changed. 'You might have heard of me, my call sign is Romeo,' she paused while the pilots giggled and sniggered."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "28321dc7-3377-48e0-b5ce-799326720754",
                                                "sense_id": "a8908509-2e8a-313e-b7ef-a7b7973add01",
                                                "text": "He’d begun the day’s broadcast by rattling off a standard opening monologue: “Folks, we’re live and alive, and I hope all the boys, girls, and enbies”—nonbinary people—“are having a fantastic one.”"
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "enby",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "067e3655-e7b0-35d5-af6f-b45bbc176d72",
                                        "entry_id": "91ba9d0a-7bae-3a81-8cb6-91e61303bb7e",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Pronunciation spelling of NB (“non-binary; having or pertaining to a gender identity that is not strictly female or male, that is, outside of the gender binary”)."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "alt-of",
                                            "informal",
                                            "neologism",
                                            "not-comparable",
                                            "pronunciation-spelling"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "33adfdbd-bd68-458d-b938-b923170e1a2c",
                                                "sense_id": "067e3655-e7b0-35d5-af6f-b45bbc176d72",
                                                "text": "For non-binary-identified (or, to use my current favourite term, enby) people, this is magnified by the fact that while most of everyone except Germaine Greer and Donald Trump are prepared to recognise that trans people do exist these days, the enby population is still struggling up that hill with our glitter in the one hand and our neckties in the other."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "69c65774-4220-45ec-8e63-9c8750338420",
                                                "sense_id": "067e3655-e7b0-35d5-af6f-b45bbc176d72",
                                                "text": "You've campaigned for non-binary and gender non-conforming people at Newcastle for a while now, including winning Campaign of the Year last year for your Beyond The Binary Week when you served as Marginalised Genders Officer, and appearing on BBC3's web shows. Would you consider yourself an enby BNOC [big name on campus]?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "c31c4f65-dfd3-46c6-8882-3b32e9444a65",
                                                "sense_id": "067e3655-e7b0-35d5-af6f-b45bbc176d72",
                                                "text": "\"As an enby transgxrl, and an enbie lesbian, the lesbian community needs to show [more] validation towards those who are both non-binary and lesbians. […] I know that I am valid as a lesbian so I just don't let those views affect me, and the enby community needs to be welcoming of nb lesbians a[s] well,\" says Evee Sams, a lesbian, polyamorous, agender, trans gxrl."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7c587954-61b1-488f-ad5d-a49bb695442c",
                                                "sense_id": "067e3655-e7b0-35d5-af6f-b45bbc176d72",
                                                "text": "The Bulls also are welcoming SWISH, a BIPOC basketball meet-up group that provides a space for queer women, trans and enby (non-binary) players to feel held, seen and valued."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
